        <section class="rounded-xl bg-white border p-4"><div class="flex justify-between"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Planned versus actual consumption</h2>@if(auth()->user()->hasPermission('manage_feed_issues'))<a class="underline text-emerald-700" href="{{ route('feed.issues.create') }}">Record feeding</a>@endif</div><p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Feed is recorded per stage; one saved daily target per stage and feed type. Older group deliveries match a stage or location filter when their saved population includes it. Unknown means the original issue has no reliable plan. Variance is not automatically classified as wastage or underfeeding.</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="min-w-full text-sm"><thead><tr>@foreach(['Date','Fed to','Feed / stages','Planned kg','Actual kg','Variance kg','Variance %'] as $label)<th class="p-3 text-left">{{ $label }}</th>@endforeach</tr></thead><tbody>
